        <li><strong>Median update lag across all records: {overall_median_lag:.1f} hours</strong> (approximately {overall_median_lag/24:.1f} days).</li>
        <li>Mean update lag: <strong>{np.mean(overall_lags):.1f} hours</strong> ({np.mean(overall_lags)/24:.1f} days). The positive skew (mean > median) reflects a long tail of stations with very stale data.</li>
