        <li><strong>Variation in lag across fuel types</strong> may indicate that certain fuel grades receive less frequent attention from retailers when updating their feeds.</li>
        <li>A <strong>mandated maximum update interval</strong> (e.g., requiring retailers to refresh prices at least weekly) could improve data freshness, particularly for the tail of stale records.</li>
